      "sourceTextSha256": "7c1c66ca03bbcf1f61b7c02226f11a123e1d1f2c1c5da90104f2ccd84d2a70df",
      "text": "Experience the famous Carnival of Rio de Janeiro, one of the largest and most colourful cultural events on the planet, at the Parade of Champions. Then see the Iguazu Falls, one of the widest waterfall systems in the world, the elegant architecture of Buenos Aires, Santiago at the foot of the Andes, the Atacama and the natural wonders of the Uyuni Salt Flat, the floating islands of the Uros on Lake Titicaca, and finally the mysterious Machu Picchu.",
